            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಧಿಸು — vidhisu — \"to impose (a penalty)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನ್ಯಾಯಾಧೀಶರು ಕಳ್ಳನಿಗೆ ದಂಡ ವಿಧಿಸಿದರು. nyāyādhīśaru kaḷḷanige daṇḍa vidhisidaru. The judge imposed a fine on the thief."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ವಿಧಿಸಿದೆ, vidhiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Punishments, fines, taxes and rules are imposed; the person takes -ಗೆ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
