          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಧಿಸು (vidhisu) is built on Sanskrit vidhi, \"a rule, an ordinance\", and \"fate\" (CDIAL 11755), with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
